<title>PARAGUAY: Paraguay gold prospecting leads to large find.</title>
<headline>Paraguay gold prospecting leads to large find.</headline>
<dateline>ASUNCION 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gold prospecting by a U.S. firm in Paraguay has led to a find of a considerable concentration of the precious metal, official sources said Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;Prospecting carried out by the firm Yamana Resources Inc has led to a find of a gold concentration of a little more than three percent in the areas extracted,&quot; Agustin Lopez Nunez, director of mineral resources at the Public Works Ministry, told Reuters.</p>
</text>
